{"id": "EUVD-2026-80706", "enisaUuid": "f0460c83-e953-386c-b0c8-3b98bfebebef", "description": "zlt2000 microservices-platform through 6.0.0 contains an authorization bypass vulnerability in the search-center service that allows authenticated attackers to read any Elasticsearch index by specifying the index name in POST /search/{indexName} and GET /agg/requestStat/{indexName}/{routing} path variables. Attackers can query arbitrary indices including sys_user to retrieve sensitive user records and password hashes without proper access controls.", "datePublished": "2026-09-16T13:16:44", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-18T17:48:11", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/zlt2000/microservices-platform/blob/v6.0.0/zlt-business/search-center/search-server/src/main/java/com/central/search/controller/SearchController.java#L36", "https://github.com/zlt2000/microservices-platform/blob/v6.0.0/zlt-business/search-center/search-server/src/main/java/com/central/search/controller/AggregationController.java#L33", "https://github.com/LinYuanyi1/cve-request-poc/blob/master/microservice-platform/C24_search_any_index.py", "https://github.com/LinYuanyi1/cve-request-poc/blob/master/microservice-platform/C22_request_stat_agg.py", "https://github.com/zlt2000/microservices-platform", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/microservices-platform-through-6.0.0-arbitrary-elasticsearch-index-read-via-search-center"], "aliases": ["GHSA-hj6r-7gmv-7mph", "CVE-2026-92468"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.48, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "e41f3897-d77a-3be5-ba73-2c2ec47916a2", "product": {"name": "microservices-platform", "vendor": {"name": "zlt2000"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22646.0.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "4f4b5ae3-3398-31ec-a2ed-b6d0e12d113f", "vendor": {"name": "zlt2000"}}], "isExploited": false}